        "TileImage": "$($repository 9e85c891-9eb7-4f3c-8115-896bf54d979b).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47.\r\rAn electricity fanatic has contracted us with eliminating a list of targets solely using elecrtocution methods.\r\rThey have informed us that they do not tolerate sloppiness, and expect a perfect execution in a timely manner. While this may seem tough at first glance, I know you always find a way to get the job done.\r\rYour first target to fry is Alma Reynard, situated in Hawke&apos;s Bay, New Zealand. I will leave you to prepare.",
